The king's charter is a single page. It gives the March of Ashmark every acre of the Remote Land, a chain of islands at the edge of every map, on the one condition that Ashmark goes and takes them.

.

The Tidewatch holds the same charter from a different king.

.

<b>From the quartermaster's ledger</b>

<i>Boats: three. Soldiers: enough. Captain: new.</i>

<i>We land at dawn.</i>

<i>Edda</i>

.

Nobody thought to ask who was living there already.
